@title PLC: the address style is chosen in the Add PLC card dialog and in the I/O list
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Critical audit C-60: the engine writes four address styles but nothing offered them. The card dialog has an "Address style" row, Ctrl+K "siemens" finds the card dialog and the I/O list, and the I/O list header has an "Addresses" choice. Siemens writes digital %I4.3 where IEC writes %IX4.3 (analog %IW6 is the same in both); Rockwell writes slot and channel.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "siemens"
wait 5
shot palette-siemens
key Escape
wait 3
key ctrl+k
text "add plc card"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Add PLC card"
expect "Address style"
click_text "IEC 61131"
wait 5
shot dialog-style-open
click_text Siemens Button
wait 5
shot dialog-siemens
click_text "Add card"
wait 10
click_text Reports #2
wait 10
click_text "I/O list"
wait 20
expect "Addresses"
shot io-list-siemens
check_layout
click 475 53
wait 5
shot io-list-style-open
click_text Rockwell Button
wait 20
expect "Local:"
shot io-list-rockwell
check_layout
check_blank io-list-rockwell
